 executes a separate Kellogg Snacks DSDD Agreement in the form and on the terms and conditions then offered to similarly situated distributors. The execution of the new Kellogg Snacks DSDD Agreement will terminate this Agreement, except for DISTRIBUTOR’s guarantees and the posttermination and post-expiration provisions under this Agreement. 6. That the DISTRIBUTOR (and all shareholders of a corporate assignor, and all partners of a partnership assignor, all proprietors of a proprietorship assignor and all shareholders of the general partner of a limited partnership assignor) executes a general release of any and all claims, demands and causes of action which COMPANY and it’s partners, proprietors, directors, officers, shareholders, Nd (iii) (iv) (v) executors, administrators and assigns (as the case may be) may or might have against COMPANY and it’s affiliates, and their respective officers, directors, shareholders, agents, attorneys, contractors and employees in their corporate and individual capacities including, without limitation, claims arising under federal, state and local laws, rules and ordinances. if That DISTRIBUTOR remains liable for all the obligations to COMPANY arising out of or related to this Agreement before the effective date of the transfer or assignment, and executes all instruments reasonably requested by us to evidence this liability. 8, That DISTRIBUTOR does not represent to the proposed assignee that they are purchasing anything beyond the rights to sign a new DSDD agreement with COMPANY."
