    "name": "Exhibit B – Excluded Channels of Trade",
    "text": "4 EXCLUDED CHANNELS OF TRADE Territory and Customers shall not include the list of Channels of Trade unless authorized by COMPANY (as may be amended in COMPANY’S sole discretion from time to time): Mass merchandisers (e.g., Target and Wal-Mart); DISTRIBUTOR may distribute to Kmart under this Agreement. Club stores (e.g., BJ's Wholesale and Costco); Mass market home stores (e.g., Home Depot and Lowe’s); Mass market auto stores (e.g., Auto Zone and Advance Auto Parts); Mass market toy stores (e.g., Toys “R” Us and K-B Toys); Specialty toy stores (whether independent or chain); Mid tier stores (e.g., JC Penney, Kohl's and Sears); Department stores (e.g., May Company and Macy's); Drug stores (whether independent or chain); Convenience stores (whether independent or chain); Liquor stores (whether independent or chain); Book stores and college bookstores (whether independent or chain); Specialty stores (including airport stores and military exchange stores, whether independent or chain); Specialty domestics retailers (whether independent or chain); Office supply stores (whether independent or chain); Party supply stores (whether independent or chain); Electronics stores (whether independent or chain); Card and gift stores (whether independent or chain); Gift stores (whether independent or chain); Stationery stores (whether independent or chain); Arts and craft stores (whether independent or chain); Music stores (whether independent or chain); Video stores (whether independent or chain); Comic book stores (whether independent or chain); Retailers known in the industry or classified as so-called \"99 cent\", “value discount stores”, \"dollar stores\" or liquidator\" stores Chain Warehouse programs Limited Assortment Discounters (e.g. Save-A-Lot, Aldi)"
  },
  {
