    "name": "Exhibit B – Existing-customer exception",
    "text": "Notwithstanding the foregoing, until further notice from COMPANY it shall be permissible for DISTRIBUTOR to continue selling products to, and servicing, any of its customers as of the date hereof who fall within the above schedule."
