  {
    "id": "c079",
    "name": "Exhibit C – No Kellogg relationship",
    "text": "DSDD INDEMNIFICATION The undersigned independent distributor (hereafter, “Ind.Distr.”) hereby acknowledges and agrees that, except to the extent expressly set forth herein, there exists no relationship of any kind, contractual or otherwise, between Ind.Distr. and KELLOGG SALES COMPANY D/B/A KELLOGG SNACKS (hereinafter “Kellogg”) and that any and all rights Ind.Distr. may have relating to the purchase, distribution, and/or sale of Kellogg products (hereinafter “Products”) are derived solely from TWO LOCKS, INC. d/b/a PREMIER SNACK DISTRIBUTORS (hereinafter “Premier”) pursuant to any agreement or understanding that may from time-to-time be in effect by and between Premier and Ind.Distr.. Ind.Distr. shall not represent that it holds any interest in Kellogg nor that it is in an agent or partner of Kellogg. No employee or agent of Ind.Distr. shall, as an employee or agent of Ind.Distr., be considered or deemed in any way to be an employee or agent of Kellogg. No agreement or relationship existing between Ind.Distr. and Premier shall be construed as constituting Ind.Distr. as a partner or agent of Kellogg or as creating a relationship of employer-employee, franchisor, franchisee, or principal-agent between Ind.Distr. and Kellogg."
  },
  {
    "id": "c080",
    "name": "Exhibit C – Intellectual-property protection",
    "text": "Ind.Distr. shall at all times recognize, respect, and protect Kellogg’s rights of total ownership of any and al trademarks, patents, and/or other intellectual property rights associated with the Products and shall not take any action, nor fail to take any actions, that has the effect, as determined by Kellogg in its sole and absolute discretion, of derogating, diminishing and/or weakening Kellogg’s rights in any such trademark, patent, and/or other intellectual property right, including, but not limited to, any actual or attempted utilization by Ind.Distr. of any Kellogg trademark, patent, and/or other intellectual property right in connection with the purchase, distribution, and/or sale of any goods other than those manufactured, produced, or sold by Kellogg."
