    "name": "Exhibit C – Direct distributions and sales",
    "text": "Ind.Distr. hereby acknowledges that Kellogg may, from time-to-time engage in direct distributions and/or sales of Products or other goods produced, manufactured, distributed, and/or sold by Kellogg to customers and/or potential customers of Ind.Distr. to the extent permitted by the agreement then in effect between Kellogg and Premier. In such event Ind.Distr. acknowledges and agrees that it shall have no right or cause of action against Kellogg."
