    "text": "Ind.Distr. shall not, under any circumstances, expand, enhance, and/or otherwise increase, or attempt to expand, enhance, and/or otherwise increase, any warranty or guarantee made by Kellogg with respect to any Product, which expansion, enhancement, and/or other increase, or attempt thereof, has the effect, as determined by Kellogg in its sole and absolute discretion, of expanding and/or otherwise increasing Kellogg’s potential liability with respect to Products."
